/** \page simplices Conforming simplex export
 *
 * p4est export conforming triangle (2D) and tetrahedron (3D) meshes.
 *
 * This functionality, pending publication, resides in \ref p4est_tnodes.h
 * and \ref p8est_tnodes.h.
 *
 * ## General idea
 *
 * Given a forest after \ref p4est_balance, \ref p4est_ghost_new and \ref
 * p4est_lnodes_new with degree of either 1 or 2, you may call
 * \ref p4est_tnodes_new_Q1_P1 or \ref p4est_tnodes_new_Q2_P1, respectively,
 * and of course their 3D equivalents.
 * This function generates a structure of lookup tables that define a
 * parallel distributed conforming simplex mesh.
 * Its vertices are identically the nodes of the Q1 or Q2 lnode structure.
 */
